       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. POWERFUNCTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 BASE-VAL PIC 9(3) VALUE 2.
       01 EXP-VAL PIC 9(2) VALUE 10.
       01 RESULT PIC 9(9) VALUE 1.
       01 I PIC 9(2).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > EXP-VAL
               MULTIPLY RESULT BY BASE-VAL GIVING RESULT
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "RESULT: " RESULT
           STOP RUN.
